From 372d9fae66ee36202d498c5a6fbe0a21cf3b388b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yonghong Song <yhs@fb.com>
Date: Sat, 9 May 2020 10:59:11 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 0381/1090] UPSTREAM: bpf: Add task and task/file iterator
 targets

Only the tasks belonging to "current" pid namespace
are enumerated.

For task/file target, the bpf program will have access to
  struct task_struct *task
  u32 fd
  struct file *file
where fd/file is an open file for the task.

Change-Id: Iafe23f58c6fe5b2f4d4eafd88a29194cc375b918
Signed-off-by: Yonghong Song <yhs@fb.com>
Signed-off-by: Alexei Starovoitov <ast@kernel.org>
Acked-by: Andrii Nakryiko <andriin@fb.com>
Link: https://lore.kernel.org/bpf/20200509175911.2476407-1-yhs@fb.com
