From ca5d084ab386543c2d4088de0ee52a043ff86ade Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Simon Horman <simon.horman@netronome.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Oct 2017 10:41:16 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 0455/1090] BACKPORT: flow_dissector: dissect tunnel info

Move dissection of tunnel info from the flower classifier to the flow
dissector where all other dissection occurs.  This should not have any
behavioural affect on other users of the flow dissector.

Change-Id: I45445bd2cf4537cd74acf6d4f0ae7e6c4c8dac21
