From 4b65ae5c84a3d1a30e6c0890d22601d07ea559ce Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Song Liu <songliubraving@fb.com>
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2020 11:06:44 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 0551/1090] UPSTREAM: bpf: Separate bpf_get_[stack|stackid] for
