Link: https://lore.kernel.org/lkml/YNTAqiE7CWJhOK2M@nuc10
Link: https://lore.kernel.org/lkml/20210615101515.GC26027@arm.com
Link: https://syzkaller.appspot.com/bug?extid=5d895828587f49e7fe9b
