[ Upstream commit 5e21bb4e812566aef86fbb77c96a4ec0782286e4 ]

These two types of XDP progs (BPF_XDP_DEVMAP, BPF_XDP_CPUMAP) will not be
executed directly in the driver, therefore we should also not directly
