From f7c940235e723c02a6258bb3ae28f91a1465b932 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ondrej Mosnacek <omosnace@redhat.com>
Date: Fri, 22 Feb 2019 15:57:13 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1004/1090] UPSTREAM: kernfs: do not alloc iattrs in
 kernfs_xattr_get

This is a read-only operation, so we can simply return -ENODATA if
kn->iattr is NULL.

Change-Id: I60499b89c27453d76da50c427435f9ad0ceed5a2
Signed-off-by: Ondrej Mosnacek <omosnace@redhat.com>
