From 03e8535464ccf8843bbdbe27a907663a25a630f2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: John Johansen <john.johansen@canonical.com>
Date: Wed, 6 Sep 2017 02:53:15 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1021/1090] UPSTREAM: apparmor: add first substr match to dfa

Change-Id: Ib546926d8e6718bab4e3f69056d9faee664ca78e
Signed-off-by: John Johansen <john.johansen@canonical.com>
Acked-by: Seth Arnold <seth.arnold@canonical.com>
---
