From d74433628f647918336cbbd9209acf375d46c971 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Casey Schaufler <casey@schaufler-ca.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Nov 2018 09:30:56 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1043/1090] BACKPORT: Infrastructure management of the cred
 security blob

Move management of the cred security blob out of the
security modules and into the security infrastructre.
Instead of allocating and freeing space the security
modules tell the infrastructure how much space they
require.

Change-Id: I6c6093e9d15efb9c89ecb347d2931e662c0232bb
Signed-off-by: Casey Schaufler <casey@schaufler-ca.com>
Reviewed-by: Kees Cook <keescook@chromium.org>
[kees: adjusted for ordered init series]
Signed-off-by: Kees Cook <keescook@chromium.org>
