From 44f168717c76e47e69c335b4a3689cb121a6e4ab Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Casey Schaufler <casey@schaufler-ca.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Nov 2018 12:02:49 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1046/1090] BACKPORT: LSM: Infrastructure management of the
 file security

Move management of the file->f_security blob out of the
individual security modules and into the infrastructure.
The modules no longer allocate or free the data, instead
they tell the infrastructure how much space they require.

Change-Id: I43c6b69dbc7745217c6e0a0283aae7fa1eca568c
